<title>BELGIUM: CYCLING-KONYCHEV WINS WALLOON GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-KONYCHEV WINS WALLOON GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>NAMUR, Belgium 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Dmitry Konychev won the 194-km Walloon Grand Prix cycle race on Monday.</p>
<p>Laurent Madouas of France finished second and Italy's Davide Casarotto was third.</p>
</text>
